Probably in your version of nethack, the only way to get Excalibur is to dip
your long sword into the fourtain and a lot of interesting things can happen.
You may unleash a water demon (sometimes he may grant you a wish but don't
expect he will give you the excalibur!) or attract snakes, create a lot of 
 swimming pools (unluckly human being don't know how to swim),etc.
 One of the many possibility is a murky hand will raise from the fourtain and
bless your  long sword to become excalibur.

Before you do this, probably it is better for you to make your sword rust-proof
first because  dipping a sword into water may rust it. By my experience, you
can inrease your chance of getting excalibur by:
1)            dipping it into potion of holy water and hence bless it
2)            try to increase your luck factor ( I learn this from one of
              the spoiler's document of nethack and probably I should let
              you figure it out yourself, it should cause more fun)

It seems to me that excalibur can cause more damage to the monsters (esp. the
ghosts   and with excalibur, you have much better chance to destroy it throgh
hand-combat).  By the way, I want to ask a few questions to the 
more-experienced hack/nethack addict:
1)             what's the other advantages of having excalibur ?
2)             is it possible to enchant your weapon beyond +7 without
               vaporizing it? 
